  triage:title "MESSAGES_PATH duplicated as a private string literal instead of consuming the canonical route table" ;
  triage:description "ruthless-boundary-qa (RBQA-AL2-F001) reports that the new handler duplicates the MESSAGES_PATH route string as a private literal instead of consuming atm-core's canonical route table. This matches a previously-fixed pattern from an earlier phase, AI24-IMPORTANT-001. Source: quality-mgr AL2-QA-1 verdict, ATM message-id 01KZAYN25F8XMBDDFTSBEEJSM4, PR #768 comment. The handler should derive the path from atm_core::api::http_route_surface() rather than declaring a duplicate constant." ;
